{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03152","headline":"登临沮楼 · 张九龄","name":"登临沮楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高深不可厌，巡属复来过。\n本与衆山绝，况兹韶景和。\n危楼入水倒，飞槛向空摩。\n杂树缘青壁，樛枝挂绿萝。\n潭清能彻底，鱼乐好跳波。\n有象言虽具，无端思转多。\n同怀不在此，孤赏欲如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}